# Netlify (and compatible static hosts): https://docs.netlify.com/routing/headers/
# CSP is intentionally omitted: CloudKit JS + Sign in with Apple use many Apple endpoints
# and dynamic flows; a tight CSP on static `serve` broke the login screen. Add CSP at
# your reverse proxy after testing with Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only if needed.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
